    {
      "id": "yuan-206",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·蟾宫曲·怀古",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "阿鲁威",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "鸱夷后那个清闲？谁爱雨笠烟蓑，七里严湍。除却巢由，更无人到，颍水箕山。叹落日孤鸠往还，笑桃源洞口谁关？试问刘郎，几度花开，几度花残？\n问人间谁是英雄？有酾酒临江，横槊曹公。紫盖黄旗，多应借得，赤壁东风。更惊起南阳卧龙，便成名八阵图中。鼎足三分，一分西蜀，一分江东。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "d534e0edfe4c99d380e6716a6588fb73593219dc59fd73a96ceba750e64d0b51",
      "estimatedOutput": 864,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-206--d534e0edfe4c99d380e6716a6588fb73593219dc59fd73a96ceba750e64d0b51.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-207",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·楚天遥带清江引",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "薛昂夫",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "花开人正欢，花落春如醉，春醉有时醒，人老欢难会。一江春水流，万点杨花坠，谁道是杨花，点点离人泪。回首有情风万里，渺渺天无际。愁共海潮来，潮去愁难退；更那堪晚来风又急。\n屈指数春来，弹指惊春去，蛛丝网落花，也要留春住，几日喜春晴，几日愁春雨，六曲小山屏，题满伤春句。春若有情应解语，问着无凭据。江东日暮云，渭北春天树，不知那答儿是春住处。\n有意送春归，无计留春住，明年又着来。何似休归去。桃花也解愁，点点飘红玉，目断楚天遥，不见春归路。春若有情春更苦，暗里韶光度。夕阳山外山，春水渡旁渡，不知那答儿是春住处。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "37d5da43eac1bc9c441ee3b93784c6cb3ccf10f277b53573044785b34bd41bda",
      "estimatedOutput": 1106,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-207--37d5da43eac1bc9c441ee3b93784c6cb3ccf10f277b53573044785b34bd41bda.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-208",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "山坡羊",
      "subtitle": "山光如淀",
      "author": "薛昂夫",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "山光如淀，湖光如练，一步一个生绡面。叩逋仙，访坡仙，拣西湖好处都游遍，管甚月明归路远。\n船，休放转；杯，休放浅。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "dfb3a5a6093cb2669177f628c4ddfc37584c58d833cee3f92bb9c5140d620f27",
      "estimatedOutput": 712,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-208--dfb3a5a6093cb2669177f628c4ddfc37584c58d833cee3f92bb9c5140d620f27.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-209",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "正宫·塞鸿秋",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "薛昂夫",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "功名万里忙如燕，斯文一脉微如线。光阴寸隙流如电，风霜两鬓白如练。尽道便休官，林下何曾见？至今寂寞彭泽县。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e3ee1c7b40d3c9f1322e03dcd5672fca26a44a89b3504d3a33e9fc9077623fc5",
      "estimatedOutput": 704,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-209--e3ee1c7b40d3c9f1322e03dcd5672fca26a44a89b3504d3a33e9fc9077623fc5.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-210",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·蟾宫曲·雪",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "薛昂夫",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "天仙碧玉琼瑶，点点杨花，片片鹅毛。访戴归来，寻梅懒去，独钓无聊。一个饮羊羔红炉暖阁，一个冻骑驴野店溪桥，你自评跋，那个清高，那个粗豪？",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "77394f5fd8a9941276cdff7429e8e3584ed1e99a8b8f05c87f5e87a225d6b814",
      "estimatedOutput": 734,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-210--77394f5fd8a9941276cdff7429e8e3584ed1e99a8b8f05c87f5e87a225d6b814.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-211",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "山坡羊·中吕·西湖杂咏·秋",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "薛昂夫",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "疏林红叶，芙蓉将谢，天然妆点秋屏列。断霞遮，夕阳斜，山腰闪出闲亭榭。分付画船且慢者。歌，休唱彻；诗，乘兴写。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "9ffd8688b7ecb3848019a1235647a7630245fbb1f8e2e1b1de138bad8820244e",
      "estimatedOutput": 708,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-211--9ffd8688b7ecb3848019a1235647a7630245fbb1f8e2e1b1de138bad8820244e.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-212",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "山坡羊·中吕·述怀",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "薛昂夫",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "大江东去，长安西去，为功名走遍天涯路。\n厌舟车，喜琴书，早星星鬓影瓜田暮。\n心待足时名便足：高，高处苦；低，低处苦。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "48b92419b059e962bd1d3b8d2adab66cdbb2770e4b04b6119ead3a5cb6e324e9",
      "estimatedOutput": 716,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-212--48b92419b059e962bd1d3b8d2adab66cdbb2770e4b04b6119ead3a5cb6e324e9.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-213",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "黄钟·人月圆·春日湖上",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "薛昂夫",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "东风西子湖边路，白发强寻春。尽教年少，金鞭俊影，罗帕香尘。蹇驴破帽，荒池废苑，流水闲云。恼余归思，花前燕子，墙里佳人。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "06c394fdb6a4ee4dfb4076029d6635bd7ab860fc1907d4663ff38d87db0d6243",
      "estimatedOutput": 718,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-213--06c394fdb6a4ee4dfb4076029d6635bd7ab860fc1907d4663ff38d87db0d6243.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-214",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调.水仙子·怀古",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "薛昂夫",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "秋风远塞皂雕旗，明月高台金凤杯。红妆青为苍生计，女妖绕能有几？两蛾眉千古光辉：汉和番昭君去，越吞吴西子归，战马空肥。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "14a305f2d8d697b5690f9ffaa04e17f6635c3a64683d6aba3bf23cfe86c36a1d",
      "estimatedOutput": 716,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-214--14a305f2d8d697b5690f9ffaa04e17f6635c3a64683d6aba3bf23cfe86c36a1d.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-215",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "中吕·普天乐·秋怀",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "张可久",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "为谁忙，莫非命。西风驿马，落月书灯。青天蜀道难，红叶吴江冷。\n两字功名频看镜，不饶人白发星星。钓鱼子陵，思莼季鹰，笑我飘零。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "2a1e8549743e5bb57e4a26e3110d7de9d7bba276d04f1e28785612fc4a200c0e",
      "estimatedOutput": 724,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-215--2a1e8549743e5bb57e4a26e3110d7de9d7bba276d04f1e28785612fc4a200c0e.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-216",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·水仙子·次韵",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "张可久",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "蝇头老子五千言，鹤背扬州十万钱。白云两袖吟魂健，赋庄生《秋水》篇，布袍宽风月无边。名不上琼林殿，梦不到金谷园，海上神仙。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "465034f9b2688c587a110f041a302778effd3f263702a16bff9f6d63fc5f50a2",
      "estimatedOutput": 720,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-216--465034f9b2688c587a110f041a302778effd3f263702a16bff9f6d63fc5f50a2.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-217",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "山坡羊",
      "subtitle": "云松螺髻",
      "author": "张可久",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "云松螺髻，香温鸳被，掩香闺一觉伤春睡。柳花飞，小琼姬，一片声雪下呈祥瑞。\n把团圆梦儿生唤起。谁，不做美？吓，却是你！",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "7054653071cf8d46376baf7143ef6b6b4d3dca2db8252acb4ca461aac9cab11b",
